<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on six Swiss stocks.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on six Swiss stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued American-style call warrants on shares of six Swiss stocks, lead manager Citibank (Switzerland) Zurich said.</p>
<p>The stocks are Adecco SA, Alusuisse-Lonza Holding AG, ABB AG, Clariant AG, CS Group and Holderbank Financire Glarus AG.</p>
<p>The warrants are exercisable from July 3, 1997 until November 23, 1998 and are available in minimum exercise lots of 100. They are all listed on the Swiss stock exchange.</p>
</text>
